To start the application, use the following command:

```bash
php -S 0.0.0.0:5000 -t public
```

This will start the Lumen application on port `5000`, and it will be ready to accept requests at the `/compile` endpoint. The application will compile TypeScript and C++ code snippets and return the results as specified in the OpenAPI schema. The improvements ensure that the application is secure against potential vulnerabilities.

